---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";

const pageTitle = "Terms of Service";
const pageDescription = "Review the terms and conditions governing the use of Nexus Digital Innovations services and website.";
---

<Layout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
    <div class="relative min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden">
        <Navbar />

        <main class="pt-40 pb-24">
            <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
                <div class="mb-16">
                    <span class="text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-nexus-purple mb-4 block">Legal</span>
                    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-display font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6 tracking-tight transition-colors">
                        Terms of <span class="text-gradient">Service</span>
                    </h1>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest font-medium">Last updated: March 2026</p>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-12 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 font-light leading-relaxed transition-colors">
                    <section>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4 font-display transition-colors">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
                        <p>By accessing and using the Nexus Digital Innovations website and services, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please discontinue use of our services.</p>
                    </section>

                    <section>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4 font-display transition-colors">2. Services</h2>
                        <p class="mb-4">Nexus Digital Innovations provides enterprise technology services including but not limited to:</p>
                        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
                            <li>Cloud infrastructure architecture and migration</li>
                            <li>Generative AI solutions and implementation</li>
                            <li>Cybersecurity consulting and implementation</li>
                            <li>CTO and CISO as a Service</li>
                            <li>End-to-end digital transformation delivery</li>
                            <li>Strategic technology consulting</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p class="mt-4">Specific service terms, deliverables, and pricing are defined in individual service agreements between Nexus Digital Innovations and the client.</p>
                    </section>

                    <section>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4 font-display transition-colors">3. Intellectual Property</h2>
                        <p>All content, designs, logos, trademarks, and intellectual property displayed on this website are owned by Nexus Digital Innovations unless otherwise stated. You may not reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works from our content without prior written consent.</p>
                    </section>

                    <section>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4 font-display transition-colors">4. Client Obligations</h2>
                        <p class="mb-4">When engaging our services, clients agree to:</p>
                        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
                            <li>Provide accurate and complete information necessary for service delivery</li>
                            <li>Maintain the confidentiality of any credentials or access provided</li>
                            <li>Comply with applicable laws and regulations</li>
                            <li>Adhere to payment terms specified in service agreements</li>
                        </ul>
                    </section>

                    <section>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4 font-display transition-colors">5. Confidentiality</h2>
                        <p>Both parties agree to maintain the confidentiality of any proprietary or sensitive information exchanged during the course of service delivery. This obligation extends beyond the termination of any service agreement.</p>
                    </section>

                    <section>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4 font-display transition-colors">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
                        <p>To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, Nexus Digital Innovations shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages resulting from the use or inability to use our services. Our total liability shall not exceed the fees paid for the specific service giving rise to the claim.</p>
                    </section>

                    <section>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4 font-display transition-colors">7. Governing Law</h2>
                        <p>These terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with applicable laws. Any disputes arising from these terms or our services shall be resolved through good-faith negotiation, and if necessary, through binding arbitration.</p>
                    </section>

                    <section>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4 font-display transition-colors">8. Modifications</h2>
                        <p>Nexus Digital Innovations reserves the right to modify these Terms of Service at any time. Changes will be effective upon posting to this page. Your continued use of our services following any changes constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.</p>
                    </section>

                    <section>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4 font-display transition-colors">9. Contact</h2>
                        <p>For questions regarding these terms, please contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@nexusinnova.com" class="text-nexus-blue hover:underline font-medium">hello@nexusinnova.com</a>.</p>
                    </section>
                </div>
            </div>
        </main>

        <Footer />
    </div>
</Layout>
